nd have a recovery method; no credentials requested here."], "risk": {"level": "low", "reasons": ["Informational notice with no personal data required", "Main failure is a stale or late status causing wasted trips", "Safety, location and audience size are unknown", "Late decisions a few hours before start (owner-confirmed) mean people need to know to re-check", "Single decision-maker is a single point of failure if unavailable"]}, "recommendation": {"summary": "Proposed, not owner-confirmed: no custom build for now. Use one manually edited status notice on a channel members already use, or a basic hosted one-page status site if none exists.", "rationale": ["Owner makes the decision personally, so manual updating fits and automation adds little", "Existing tools likely cover this with little or no custom work (cost unverified)", "Since the owner may change the status shortly before the event, quick editing from a phone and a visible last-updated time are the key features"], "alternatives": ["Pinned post in an existing group chat or social group", "Status line on an existing club website", "Simple one-page hosted status site updated by hand (small possible cost, unverified)", "Weather-driven automatic page: more complex, not requested, and not recommended unless the owner wants it, as the owner's judgment decides"]}, "assumptions": ["Attendees have internet access", "The status can be public unless the owner says otherwise", "The owner can edit from a phone or computer", "Cost is unknown and has not been checked"], "open_questions": ["Is there an existing website, group chat or social page, and who has login access?", "Should the notice be public or members-only?", "Is there a budget, and who maintains the page if the owner is unavailable?", "Does the owner want any weather information shown?"], "acceptance_criteria": ["A visitor can see the event date and ON/OFF/NOT DECIDED YET at a glance", "The owner can change the status in a few minutes without technical help", "The notice shows when it was last updated and when the next decision is expected", "The owner can regain access if the password or device is lost", "No personal data is collected unless the owner decides otherwise"], "owner_responsibilities": ["Make the go/no-go decision and update the notice, including any change a few hours before start", "Find out which existing channels or websites the group has and who controls them", "Decide who else, if anyone, may edit the notice", "Keep login and recovery details safe", "Confirm any costs before agreeing to a paid service"]}}}

